Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look. Saturn 3 is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看 《土星三号》开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna watch Saturn 3. Deep Space Nine is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想看《土星三号》 《深空九号》比较好看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:08.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is Deep Space Nine better than Saturn 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:08.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《深空九号》怎么会比《土星三号》好看？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Simple subtraction will tell you it's six better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}减减看就知道 它好看六级
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Compromise. Watch Babylon 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:17.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就折中一下看《巴比伦五号》好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:20.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In what sense is that a compromise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:20.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这怎么叫折中？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:24.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, five is partway between three-- Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:24.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五在中间啊 在三和…算了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you what. How about we go Rock, Paper, Scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧 我们剪刀、石头、布如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:29.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:29.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anecdotal evidence suggests that in a game of Rock, Paper, Scissors...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}观察证据显示 在剪刀、石头、布的游戏中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...players familiar with each other will tie 75 to 80 percent of the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}彼此熟识的玩家会有七成到八成的时间是平手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...due to the limited number of outcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是因为组合结果的数量有限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suggest Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我建议用剪刀、石头、布、蜥蜴、斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:46.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -It's very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:46.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -这很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Scissors cuts paper, paper covers rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}剪刀可以剪布 布包石头…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:51.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...rock crushes lizard, lizard poisons Spock...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:51.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}石头砸死蜥蜴 蜥蜴毒死斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:54.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Spock smashes scissors, scissors decapitates lizard...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:54.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯波克砸烂剪刀 剪刀剪掉蜥蜴的头…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...lizard eats paper, paper disproves Spock...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蜥蜴吃掉布 布反驳斯波克…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:01:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Spock vaporizes rock, and as it always has, rock crushes scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:01:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}斯波克把石头化为蒸汽 然后跟之前一样 石头砸坏剪刀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我想我理解了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}剪刀、石头、布、蜥蜴、斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:20.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:20.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahoy, matey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呦嘿 海盗头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Noticed the eye patch, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有注意到我的眼罩吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:29.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's all part of a technique I've been studying for picking up women.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我在练习的勾搭妹子的招数之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You employ a visual display...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}运用让你看起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:36.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...designed to make yourself distinctive and memorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:36.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}独特难忘的视觉效果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:38.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes, like the male peacock with brilliant plumage...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:38.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 就像羽毛光鲜灿烂的公孔雀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:42.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or the rutting baboon with engorged hindquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:42.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是发情的狒狒那饱满的臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:46.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or in this case, the bar mitzvah boy with pink eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:46.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或根据现在的情况 是得了红眼病的犹太少男
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:49.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mock me if you will, but it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:49.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们尽管嘲笑我吧 但这招超好用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:51.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You show up in something distinctive...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:51.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你穿着独特出现在夜店
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:53.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...scope out your target and toss out some negs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:53.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}锁定目标 然后使用消极攻势策略
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are negs? -A neg is a negative compliment...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么是消极攻势？ -就是给她一些消极的评价
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that throws a pretty woman off her game, like:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能打消漂亮女人的气势 比如说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Normally, I'm not turned on by big teeth, but on you they work."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“通常 我对大牙妹没兴趣 但你让我欲火焚身”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:07.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a whole list of them. Who wants to be my wingman?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:07.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道一大堆这样的话 谁想给我当僚机？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not gonna need a wingman. You're gonna need a paramedic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不需要僚机 你需要被送去医院
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:14.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, your scooter's blocking my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你的小摩托挡到我的车了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:17.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, did you get pink eye again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:17.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又得了红眼病？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.14,0:02:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Step one: she notices the eye patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.14,0:02:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一步：她注意到我的眼罩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:26.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I say, Penny, not a lot of women could look as hot as you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:26.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 请容我说一句 像你这样满头油腻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with such greasy hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还能这么性感的女人不多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, just move your stupid scooter before I pick it up and throw it in the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好在我把你的小摩托丢进垃圾箱之前把它挪走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:44.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:10.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MUSIC PLAYING ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm sorry, but I'm not going to watch the Clone Wars TV series...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我在看过《克隆战争》电影之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...until I've seen the Clone Wars movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要看《克隆战争》电视剧版
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I prefer to let George Lucas disappoint me in the order he intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我比较喜欢依照乔治卢卡斯设定的顺序对他失望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I wanna watch it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在就想看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I believe we've arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想现在非常适合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:31.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at another quintessential Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, Spock moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:31.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用剪刀、石头、布、蜥蜴、斯波克来决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Watch whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想看什么就看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I saw what you did there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真有一套
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello? Hey, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？嘿 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, okay. Okay, we'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我们马上到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What happened? -Howard's at the Mars-rover lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -霍华德在火星探测车实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:00.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He says he's in trouble. DEFCON 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:00.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说他有麻烦了 五级危机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DEFCON 5? Well, there's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:04.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五级危机？那就不用急了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -DEFCON 5 means no danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -五级危机代表没有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DEFCON 1 is a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一级危机代表非常危险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can five not be worse than one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五级怎么会不比一级严重？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Star Trek V, worse than 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《星际迷航5》比就《星际迷航1》糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First of all, that's a comparison of quality, not intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 这是品质的比较 不是紧急程度的比较
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Secondly, Star Trek I is orders of magnitude worse than Star Trek V.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第二 《星际迷航1》比《星际迷航5》差好几倍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:24.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:24.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:28.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Star Trek V is the standard against which all badness is measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:28.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《星际迷航5》是所有烂片的基准
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Star Trek V has specific failures in writing and direction...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第五部只有剧本和导演很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:35.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while Star Trek I fails across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:35.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而第一部整个烂到爆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:37.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Art direction, costuming, music, sound editing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:37.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艺术指导、服装、配乐、音效都很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:41.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? Can we just forget I said "DEFCON" and go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:41.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 能不能别纠结我说的“危机”了 咱们赶紧过去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Star Trek V.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《星际迷航5》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Will you at least stipulate that Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你至少同意《星际迷航4：抢救未来》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is inarguably the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毫无疑问是最精彩的一部吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have three words for you: Wrath of Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只有三个字想说 第二部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:58.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank God you're here. -What's the emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:58.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还好你们来了 -什么事这么紧急？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:01.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got the Mars rover stuck in a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:01.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我让火星探测车卡在沟里了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where? -On a dusty highway...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哪里？ -一条贝克斯菲尔德市郊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just outside Bakersfield. Where do you think? On Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}满是尘土的高速公路上 你以为会在哪里？当然是在火星上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:11.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, is everything okay? -Yeah, baby, I'll be right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:11.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 都还好吧？ -没事 宝贝 我马上进去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:16.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You brought a girl to the Mars-rover control room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:16.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你把一个女孩带到火星探测车控制室？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I picked her up in the bar. She's a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊 我在酒吧钓上的 她是个医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One free barium enema...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来一次免费的钡剂灌肠检查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:22.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and my mother won't care she's not Jewish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:22.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈就不会介意她不是犹太人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute, so the eye patch and the insults worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 眼罩和侮辱的话有效？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:30.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, there were three other guys with eye patches. It was a fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:30.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那边还有三个也带眼罩的家伙 真是大失败
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did work was, "How'd you like to visit a secret government facility?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有效的是“你想不想参观政府秘密机构？”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:38.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what exactly do you want us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:38.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底要我们做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:42.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You help me get the rover out, and you get Stephanie out before somebody notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:42.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和拉吉帮我把探测车弄出来 你在别人注意到前把史黛芬妮带走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She doesn't exactly have clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她其实不能进来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? They don't let strange women from honky-tonks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？他们不让小酒吧的陌生女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:50.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...play with $200 million government projects on distant planets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:50.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乱搞政府花了两亿美元的星球计划？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I was bad. Maybe she'll spank me. Can we please move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 我坏透了 她可能会打我的屁屁 可以行动了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:06:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Howard, it's getting late, so do I get to drive this thing or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:06:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 霍华德 已经很晚了 我到底能不能开这个东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no, I'm sorry, but something's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 发生了点小意外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of a Mars rover--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是火星探测车…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:08.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mars-rover-can-Howard-come-over...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:08.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火星探测车呼叫霍华德…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:12.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...kind of situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:12.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So my friend Leonard is gonna take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的朋友莱纳德会带你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:19.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay. Let's go, friend Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:19.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们走吧 朋友莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. -I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 -我会打电话给你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}STEPHANIE: Yeah. So are you a scientist like Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也是像霍华德一样的科学家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: No one's a scientist like Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没人跟霍华德是一样的科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mother is so gonna love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈一定会很喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:34.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How nice. Maybe they can carpool when they visit you in federal prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:34.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好 或许她们到联邦监狱去看你时 可以拼车去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I totally interrupted you. What were you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我打断了你 你刚说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just said Howard's a terrific guy. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我说霍华德是个好人 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:51.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's got a great sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:51.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很有幽默感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He loves his mother a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很爱他妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some people say too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有可能太多了点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I really like that you're such a loyal friend. -Yeah, I am loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我很欣赏你是忠实的朋友 -是 我是很忠实
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, if you look at the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果从大处着眼的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just, uh, out of curiosity, did he ever have a shot with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}出于好奇我问一下 你真的被他吸引了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane? The guy was wearing an eye patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？他可是戴着眼罩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So then why did you--? -He said that I could drive a car on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那你为什么… -他说我可以在火星上开车
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:22.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Got it. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:22.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我懂了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So can I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以再见到你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not done seeing me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们现在还没见完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KEYS CLICKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有进展吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I was just checking my e-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实我只是在看邮箱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:47.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, uh, no, the rover is not responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:47.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是 没有 探测车没有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe the appropriate metaphor here involves a river of excrement...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想比较好的隐喻应该是一池恶心的臭水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:54.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and a Native American water vessel without any means of propulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:54.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和一艘没有推动力的原住民木船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, there's gotta be other options.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 一定有其它的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:08:00.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could try calling AAA.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:08:00.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以打给美国汽车协会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:04.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But based on NASA's latest timetable, they won't get there for 35 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:04.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但根据宇航局最新的时间表 他们要花35年才能到达那里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, I understand you have to be next to the vehicle with your card when they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且他们到的时候 你必须拿着你的卡在车旁边等着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真是厉害 -厉害什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:12.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:13.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Snap what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, I guess we have to turn to plan B. -What's plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想我们要进行B计划了 -B计划是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Erase the hard drives, grab the tapes, wipe our fingerprints off every surface and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}清空所有的硬盘资料 拿走监控录像 清除所有的指纹 然后跑路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why wasn't that plan A?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这为什么不是A计划？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:30.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ANNOUNCER [ON TV]: A NASA spokesman states that due to the loss of data...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:30.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宇航局发言人表示由于资料遗失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:33.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they will most likely be unable to determine the cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:33.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可能无法判定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of the Mars rover's malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火星探测车出故障的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:41.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank God for plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:41.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好有B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, didn't you say you worked on the Mars rover?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你不是在研究火星探测车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 你弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们第一次见面时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:51.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said that if I went out with you I could drive a car on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:51.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说如果我跟你约会就可以在火星上开车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Psst?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you all excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪一下 莱纳德刚打暗号要我私下跟他谈话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard is signaling that he'd like to talk to me in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Yeah, I remember specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我特别记得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:14.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You started by asking if I was from Mars because my ass was out of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:14.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一开始就问我是不是火星来的 因为我的屁屁美上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that does sound like me, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来真像是我说的 但是我没说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Is there some problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, um, listen, I have to kind of sneak out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 我要溜出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right. Goodbye. -No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 再见 -不 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If anyone asks you where I went, you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人问我去哪里 你就说不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where are you going? -I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去哪里？ -我不能告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, who would ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会问我？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't tell you that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不能告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:44.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You brought me here to inform me you can't tell me where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:44.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你叫我进来是要跟我说你不能告诉我你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you can't tell me who might ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不能告诉我谁会问？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:51.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I really didn't think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:51.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我没想清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, a moment. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 等等 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:58.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If someone-- And we don't know who this would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:58.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人…我们现在不知道这个人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:10:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--does ask where you've gone, what should I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:10:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问我你去了哪里 我该怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:02.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Tell them I went to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:02.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 就说我去办公室了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you going to the office? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去办公室吗？ -不去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:09.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, then how can I say it convincingly? -Just say, "Leonard went to the office."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:09.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那我怎么说得像真的？ -就说“莱纳德去办公室了”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:13.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Leonard went to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:13.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 莱纳德去办公室了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is--? No, not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这…不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just "Leonard went to the office."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就说“莱纳德去办公室了”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would have worked better if you told me you were going to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你直接告诉我你要去办公室 我会表现得好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, why don't I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我不相信你？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MUSIC PLAYING ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:38.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm going out for a while. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:38.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我出去一下 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:43.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't anyone wanna know where he's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人想知道他去哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, where is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 他去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard is going to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德去办公室了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So how was work today? -Busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你今天工作还好吧？ -很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I removed an appendix, a gall bladder and about a foot and a half of bowel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我割掉了一段盲肠、一个胆囊和一段46公分的肠子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm hoping that was three different guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望是三个不同的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:22.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, just the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没撑过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今天怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I'm a physicist, so I thought about stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是物理学家 所以我做了很多思考
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's it? -I wrote some of it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-就这样？ -我还把一些写了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.53,0:11:41.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you done eating? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你吃完了吗？ -吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:45.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:45.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:52.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I knew you were waiting, I would have swallowed that lasagna whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:52.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早知道你在等 我就把千层面一口吃光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}STEPHANIE [ON RECORDING]: You've reached Dr. Stephanie Barnett.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:58.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是史黛芬妮巴奈特医生 请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:59.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:12:01.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史黛芬妮 又是我 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:01.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Hey, Steph, it's me again, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're free Friday, maybe we could have something to eat at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你星期五有空 或许可以来我家吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:07.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom cooks a hell of a brisket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:07.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈做的牛胸肉很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me know. It's Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我回个话 我是霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLICKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I've had her brisket. Melts in your mouth. -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吃过她做的牛胸肉 入口即化
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should think about going to the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们该去卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:28.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a good idea, because there's a bed there, and I'm very, very, very pro-bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:28.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是好主意 那里有床 而我是床上专家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}STEPHANIE: You've reached Dr. Stephanie Barnett. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是史黛芬妮巴奈特医生 请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Hey, it's me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:42.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just wanna let you know the head count for dinner Friday has gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:42.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想让你知道刚才说的星期五晚餐人数增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My Aunt Betty and Uncle Elliot are coming in from Palm Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝蒂姑妈和艾略特姑父要从棕榈泉过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and if anybody should ask, you're half Jewish on your mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人问你 你就说你妈妈是犹太人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:55.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, call me. It's Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 记得打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:56.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLICKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:13:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you think you should tell him you're not interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:13:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得你应该告诉他你没兴趣吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want me to stop and call him back right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我现在停下来打给他？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dear God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千万不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:09.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}STEPHANIE [GIGGLING]: Oh, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LEONARD LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}STEPHANIE: You've reached Dr. Stephanie Barnett. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是史黛芬妮巴奈特医生 请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是我 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Hey, it's me again. Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:25.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, my cousins from Fort Lauderdale are flying in to meet you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:25.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我堂兄妹要从罗德岱堡飞来见你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:29.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so that means we're gonna have to move the dinner to a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:29.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们要到餐厅去吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:33.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ [SHOUTING OVER PHONE]: Tell her we're going to the Olive Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:33.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉她我们要去橄榄园
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a coupon from the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有从报纸上剪下来的折扣券
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:40.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: We're not going to the Olive Garden, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:40.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不去橄榄园 妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:45.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Oh, Mr. Big-Shot with his Red Lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:45.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 是大人物和红龙虾餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: I'll call you back when we firm up the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们敲定细节后再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:52.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:52.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey. -Hey.
