Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那女孩是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:08.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm sorry? -Well, last time you bought a new shirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:08.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说什么？ -上次你买新衬衫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was when we were dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我们约会的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what we did was in fact dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们那时候真的是在约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:17.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah, we did have a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:17.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 我们是约会过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正是 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do me a favor, tell Koothrappali that next time you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我个忙 下次看到库萨帕里时告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:29.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, she's a doctor. -Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:29.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是个医生 -真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A "doctor" doctor, or a you kind of doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是真医生还是假医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:36.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Doctor" doctor. Surgical resident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:36.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真医生 她是外科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smart, pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聪明又美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我问你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:45.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If your friend thinks he's dating someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:45.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你的朋友认为他跟某人在交往
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but he's not, because in fact, you're dating her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他没有 事实上是你在跟她交往
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...does that make you a bad person?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样算是坏人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:52.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, that depends. -On what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:52.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-看情况 -什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that friend Wolowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个朋友是沃洛维茨？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah. -Screw him, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没错 -管他呢 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you sure? -Well, have you slept with her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你确定？ -你跟她上床了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这个坏小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有几下子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:14.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Does that change things? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:14.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这样有区别吗？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So why'd you ask? -I'm nosy. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那你为什么要问？ -我爱八卦 再见
