Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:32.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, my roommate. She just went through a bad breakup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:32.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我的室友 她刚刚经历过一场痛苦的分手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:35.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought she might like to meet somebody fun like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:35.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来想她会喜欢见见像你这么风趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, Stephanie, you're alive. It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 史黛芬妮 你们复活了 真是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyway, Lisa, I just wanted to tell you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丽莎 我只想再次跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:51.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how much I enjoyed the other night, and again, I'm sorry for how it ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:51.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那晚的约会很有趣 也再次为约会那样结束向你道歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:55.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But again, if you could let me know about Friday...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:55.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我希望你能回复我星期五晚餐的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:58.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my mother needs a head count so she can know how big a brisket to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:58.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈需要知道人数 才知道要做多少牛胸肉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MAN SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论如何回电给我 我是霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:04.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, call me. It's Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:09.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ANNOUNCER [ON TV]: It's unclear how the Mars rover got into the crevice...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:09.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不清楚火星探测车为何掉入缝隙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:10.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but one thing's certain:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有一件事可以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:14.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The data which it has sent back contain the first clear indications...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:14.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送回来的资料第一次清楚地显示
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that there may have been life on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火星上可能存在过生物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:20.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a scientific discovery...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:20.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种科学发现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:23.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that has staggering implications for all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:23.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让全人类倍感震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unfortunately, we'll never know who's responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很不幸的是 我们永远不知道这是谁的功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 郑伟
